# Trust anchor for the cp314t wheelhouse that CI fetches (fetch_wheelhouse.sh).
#
# One "<sha256>  <wheel file name>" per line. A wheel is downloaded from the
# GitHub release named by the most recent "# release-tag:" line above it and is
# accepted ONLY if its sha256 matches this committed file, so swapping a release
# asset cannot change what a build ships. The release's own SHA256SUMS is never
# trusted. Append-only: add lines (and, for a new release, a new tag line);
# never edit or remove one. Provenance, licenses and the OpenCV LGPL source
# pointers are in that release's notes and in
# docs/planning/free-threaded-wheels-2026-09-30.md.
#
